Sebastian Rahtz wrote --

> to some extent I have done it, in that I _have_ classified all the
> LaTeX contrib packages on CTAN into 1, 2 or 3.

Sounds useful.

> if the LaTeX team endorse it,

"endorse it" perhaps needs some further specification.

It could mean:

1.   The LaTeX Team think this is a useful activity.

2.   The LaTeX Team think this is a useful activity and have such complete
faith in Sebastian's judgement that they agree with his classification.

3.   The LaTeX Team think this is a useful activity and have carefully
checked the results; therefore they agree with his classification.



chris

